PaymentRails_ExecuteAction
├── when token is not enabled
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_TokenNotEnabled
├── when no action is configured
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_NoActionConfigured
├── when amount is zero
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_ZeroAmount
├── when amount is below minBalance
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_BelowMinimumBalance
├── when balance is insufficient
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_InsufficientBalance
├── given valid configuration and sufficient balance
│   ├── when module execution succeeds
│   │   ├── it should return true
│   │   ├── it should transfer tokens from paymentRails to module
│   │   ├── it should emit ActionExecuted with correct fields
│   │   └── it should record msg.sender as executor in event
│   ├── when module returns success false
│   │   ├── it should return false
│   │   ├── it should not move tokens from paymentRails
│   │   ├── it should revoke module approval to zero
│   │   ├── it should not emit ActionExecuted
│   │   └── it should emit ActionFailed with module failure reason
│   ├── when module reverts
│   │   ├── it should return false
│   │   ├── it should not move tokens from paymentRails
│   │   ├── it should revoke module approval to zero
│   │   ├── it should not emit ActionExecuted
│   │   └── it should emit ActionFailed with revert reason
│   ├── when called by non-owner (permissionless)
│   │   └── it should succeed
│   ├── when module attempts reentrancy
│   │   ├── it should block the re-entrant call
│   │   └── it should complete the first call successfully
│   └── boundary conditions
│       ├── when amount equals minBalance exactly
│       │   └── it should succeed
│       ├── when amount equals paymentRails balance exactly
│       │   └── it should succeed and drain paymentRails
│       └── when minBalance is zero
│           └── it should succeed with any non-zero amount
└── fuzz
    ├── when amount is between minBalance and balance
    │   ├── it should return true
    │   └── it should transfer exact amount
    ├── when amount is below minBalance
    │   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_BelowMinimumBalance
    └── when amount exceeds balance
        └── it should revert with PaymentRails_InsufficientBalance
